OL,3,AKenya cult leader's children still
OL,4,Abeing starved weeks before trial, son
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe eldest son of Kenyan cult leader
OL,8,FPaul Mackenzie, convicted of murdering
OL,9,F191 people, says his younger siblings
OL,10,Fwere still being forced to fast as
OL,11,Frecently as two weeks ago.
OL,13,FDan Mackenzie, 27, said he reported the
OL,14,Fcase to police, who rescued eight
OL,15,Fchildren, including his five younger
OL,16,Fsiblings from their grandmother's
OL,17,Fhouse, and took them to a rescue
OL,18,Fcentre.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
