OL,3,AKenya cult leader's children still
OL,4,Abeing starved weeks before trial, son
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,F"They were basically forcibly fasted
OL,8,Fbecause they were denying food to them
OL,9,Ffor almost three days," he tells BBC's
OL,10,FNewsday.
OL,12,FHis father was found guilty on Monday
OL,13,Fof murdering 190 children and one adult
OL,14,Fwho starved to death in Shakahola
OL,15,Fforest, near the Kenyan coast.
